# Shared by both images (backend/Dockerfile and Dockerfile.web) — the build
# context is the repo root for both. Keeps the context small and secrets out.
#
# backend/certs is deliberately NOT listed: the local Norton-cert workflow
# needs it for dev builds (see backend/certs/README.md). The guard against
# shipping that CA in production images is that prod builds happen only from
# clean clones (EC2 node / CI), where the gitignored .crt never exists.

node_modules
.next
.git
.claude
tmp
evals
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pdf
.env
.env.*
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
LAUNCH_PLAN.md
